/v/t64.5771-25/39031545_1695566271189918_7563581897204183653_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E7jLj35VXoEQ7kNvwGY2P7F&_nc_oc=AdlkD6EKP9ZIoRoPk-ySzsFHnnS_x-AmKAPdqoJMjHviV-60cqlgPpYu9G1nPLcS190&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvfVr9xu_QyZ_gqNDS05hCMjVIhjJWlBYpZCyQ6AS2kWQ&oe=699C37BC"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "3751167238508534", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001725_3751167241841867_2951941851866511973_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hLUa_JLWBDEQ7kNvwE_Jl4b&_nc_oc=AdlIjuwwOvKNvIb0KQlONz1Tr-bRAR26KVjmQ1rMVkYdjTqph66dwDUKXtxGon60GZw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu0cZZMI0UmnPvVfNKbHCxPBoLVTDy5LNmvg9xSjzuqjA&oe=699C405D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1691892224915749", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75580056_1691892228249082_8993988736869608245_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OqRUHvxjvaAQ7kNvwENeDtY&_nc_oc=AdnpN6kj8HcrQkubOPiiUOEQ7e6G9EiZdG80Vkc7vIJta3rT2d_xRpHD-AZjQjlik_Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuQgMTf337Jb68l9CpnAW1q-aj2uK56_VaKOeAglNt_aw&oe=699C41DA"}, "display_name": "Stealthy Swipers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Description:\nImmerse yourself in the thrilling world of \"Stealthy Swipers,\" a cutting-edge VR game where your mission is to \"borrow\" valuable items from a vast, high-tech environment while evading detection by the colossal room owner. This game combines intense stealth mechanics, strategic gameplay, and a rich, futuristic setting to deliver an unforgettable virtual reality experience.\n\nGame Features:\n\n    Immersive VR Environment:\n        Experience a meticulously crafted, enormous space brought to life with state-of-the-art VR graphics. The game environment is designed to be visually stunning and deeply immersive, making you feel like you are truly inside a high-tech, futuristic world.\n\n    